    "Off" : {
      "comment" : "iCloud sync in a build without iCloud",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off unless you turn it on. Then your birthdays, their photos and the reminder settings sync through your private iCloud database to your devices with the same Apple Account. Each device sends its own reminders." : {
      "comment" : "Explains the iCloud sync switch in the settings",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Aus, solange du es nicht einschaltest. Dann werden deine Geburtstage, ihre Fotos und die Erinnerungseinstellungen über deine private iCloud-Datenbank mit deinen Geräten mit demselben Apple Account abgeglichen. Jedes Gerät erinnert dich selbst."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On the day" : {
      "comment" : "Reminder on the birthday itself",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Am Tag selbst"
